定の優先順位を持たず、お任せでの選定を委任する。","inconclusiveCondition":"回答が得られないか、優先順位が特定できない。","status":"pending"}],"usage":{"rounds":0,"modelCalls":2,"toolCalls":0,"elapsedMs":49745,"totalTokens":null,"costYen":null},"decision":"needs_user_input","stopReason":null,"appliedExecutions":[],"reflection":{"binding":{"taskId":"balcony-planting-g03","basedRevision":1,"understandingHash":"41d42e7d5d4e75a665dccbfd6e3d7e3457f6e78783f3e3067e881d2585d8e3d2"},"reviewedClaimIds":["c-option-a","c-option-b","c-sunlight","c-preference","c-draft-answer"],"completion":"completed","limitations":["直射日光4〜5時間は晴天時の簡易見積もりであり、季節変動や詳細な日照推移は未測定である。","利用者が何を重視するか（日照条件、鉢の配置、収穫後の用途）が未定のため、適切な案の確定判断は利用者の回答待ちである。"]},"policyHistory":{"consecutiveNoProgressRounds":0,"lastUnderstandingHash":"41d42e7d5d4e75a665dccbfd6e3d7e3457f6e78783f3e3067e881d2585d8e3d2","recentOutcomes":["progress","progress"],"lastProgressAtRevision":2},"reflectionEffects":{"binding":{"taskId":"balcony-planting-g03","basedRevision":1,"understandingHash":"41d42e7d5d4e75a665dccbfd6e3d7e3457f6e78783f3e3067e881d2585d8e3d2"},"appliedRevision":2,"addedGoalGapIds":[],"addedLensIds":[]},"excludedCandidates":[]}},"accountingUncertain":false,"lastObservedAt":1792516160629,"stopReceipts":[]}}
